flowchart TD
    User[Serial monitor user] --> Console[USB Serial/JTAG console stdin]
    Console --> MicrorlTask[microrl_task]
    MicrorlTask --> Parser[microrl parser]
    Parser --> Commands{command}

    Commands -->|setmotor M0 pwm dir| SetMotor[set M0 pwm and direction]
    Commands -->|stopmotor M0| StopMotor[set M0 pwm to 0]
    Commands -->|stop| StopAll[set every motor pwm to 0]
    Commands -->|watchsensors on/off| WatchSensors[set sensor watch flag]
    Commands -->|bad command or bad args| Error[print error]

    SetMotor --> Mutex[motor_mutex]
    StopMotor --> Mutex
    StopAll --> Mutex

    Mutex --> MotorStruct[(motors array\nM0 motor_t)]

    MotorStruct --> ControllerTask[motor_controller_task]
    ControllerTask --> DirectionGPIO[GPIO6 direction pin]
    ControllerTask --> LEDC[LEDC PWM channel]
    LEDC --> PWMGPIO[GPIO7 PWM pin]

    DirectionGPIO --> MD30C[Cytron MD30C]
    PWMGPIO --> MD30C
    MD30C --> Motor[Motor]

    SensorGPIO[S0 GPIO4 and S1 GPIO5] --> SensorTask[sensor_reader_task]
    SensorTask --> SensorStruct[(sensors array)]
    SensorTask -->|watch enabled and value changed| SensorEvent[EVENT SENSOR name old new]
    WatchSensors --> SensorWatchFlag[sensor_watch_enabled]
    SensorWatchFlag --> SensorTask
    SensorEvent --> PythonWrapper[Python wrapper]
    Error --> PythonWrapper
    MicrorlTask -->|OK and ERR lines| PythonWrapper

    FuturePCNT[future PCNT reader task] -.->|write position| MotorStruct
    FutureMQTT[future MQTT task] -.->|write commands| MotorStruct
    FuturePID[future PD/PID task] -.->|write pwm and direction| MotorStruct
